# time - Aiki time semantics over host clock capability

@func now
@template "now()"
@help "Returns the current time as integer milliseconds since the Unix epoch."

@func sleep
@template "sleep(ms)"
@help "Pauses execution for given milliseconds."

@func after
@template "after(ms)"
@help "Returns a receive-only channel that produces true once after the given milliseconds."
